<h2>What gets listed</h2><p>We look for resources relevant to cardiology or cardiac critical care, including tools, apps, courses and guidelines. Each listing describes what the resource is and covers, using information that can be checked. Suggestions outside these areas, duplicates and resources without enough information for a truthful description are not added without further review.</p>
<h2>How listings are maintained</h2><p>Suggestions are reviewed before they are added. The review checks the resource page and available information about its maker, pricing and platforms. Existing entries can be corrected or hidden when needed. To request a correction or removal, <a href="mailto:hello@marlosolutions.com?subject=MedPally%20Find%3A%20listing%20correction">email us</a>.</p>
